<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — GraniteSlug creature port (Pass 9).
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `GraniteSlug` ThingDef/
  PawnKindDef pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713),
  renamed under the RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  Body: the donor's custom `GraniteSlug` BodyDef needed a defName rename
  plus repointing its 2 "foot" parts (`SW_DorsalTentacle`) to the
  already-ported Wave B `RSW_SW_DorsalTentacle` (the same part
  RSW_Beldon/RSW_Dianoga already reuse) — every other part (Shell, Stomach,
  Lung, InsectHeart, Pronotum, InsectHead, Brain, Eye x4, InsectMouth x2)
  is vanilla Core. Ported as RSW_GraniteSlug in RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml.

  GraniteSlug needs no new resource at all — `specificMeatDef` repoints to
  the already-ported RSW_Silica_Meat (RSW_MlieWaveC_Resources.xml, Pass 2,
  Beldon — the same donor `Silica_Meat` this species itself would have
  needed). No `leatherDef` (donor's own `LeatherAmount` stat is 0, `comps`
  is empty). No egg comp — GraniteSlug reproduces via
  `gestationPeriodDays`/`litterSizeCurve`, not `CompProperties_EggLayer`.

  Art: extracted this pass via extract_bundle.py against the live Steam
  workshop bundle (workshop folder 3497316713) — 4 PNGs (GraniteSlug_north/
  south/east + GraniteSlug_Dessicated), all confirmed non-zero and
  PIL-openable. texPaths otherwise unchanged text — art sits at
  Textures/swanimals/GraniteSlug/.

  No `*ArtOverride` mod exists for this species (checked the full ~26-mod
  override-folder listing, not a remembered short list).

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: `ExtremeDesert` (0.1),
  `PoisonForest` (0.15) — per cast_assignment.csv's current rows for this
  species (cross-checked against the worklist's own biome claim and found
  correct — no staleness this pass), repointed from the bare "GraniteSlug"
  entries in cast_assignment.csv / both BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml copies.
-->
